stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Native
  Native --> Preparing: user applies theme
  Preparing --> CandidateInjected: all targets injected
  Preparing --> Native: validation/download/injection failed
  CandidateInjected --> Active: readback + health check passed
  CandidateInjected --> Native: rollback candidate
  Active --> Degraded: monitor error threshold reached
  Degraded --> Active: recovery succeeds
  Degraded --> Native: explicit restore / safe fallback
  Active --> Switching: user changes theme
  Switching --> Active: candidate succeeds, old session cleaned
  Switching --> Active: candidate fails, old session preserved
  Active --> Native: restore completes
